    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88596" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσανα-τείνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strain tight beside</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστίον [καρχησίῳ</span>] Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				5.94
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>hold out by way of threat</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ῥωμαίων φόβον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					24.10.13
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>threaten</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				18.53.9
			</span></i>: so in aor. 1
			
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βραχέα -ταθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.87.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lift up</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δεξιάν, τὼ
			χεῖρε</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ ὥρᾳ π</span>. <i>prolong</i> the
			time, <i>be later</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				11.22.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>extend along</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.7
			</span></i> cod.</div>
